# The apps and tools on every Kuberdon MacBook. `computer` installs this with
# `brew bundle`; add a line, run it again, and it installs only what is new.

# Maestro is only in its maker's tap. `computer` trusts that one formula
# (`brew trust --formula`) before it runs `brew bundle`; everything else is Homebrew's own.
tap "mobile-dev-inc/tap"

